{"unit_id":"Nicholaskin__vision-exp-tile#card-zh","repo":"Nicholaskin/vision-exp-tile","commit":"eb60e9104cc5999dda2a0a728550301be70123a8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"vision-exp-tile 是面向 DSH Web 的大图视觉识别插件，提供图片切块、区域裁剪、OCR 辅助和视觉模型识别。它在 DSH 中注册四个工具，可按网格输出带原图坐标的小块，也能预检图片、识别重点区域并汇总结果。目录批量工具支持失败隔离、进度记录与续跑。适合需要读取高分辨率截图、图表或扫描材料的用户；默认使用 DeepSeek 视觉端点，也可配置兼容服务或本地端点。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:1252-1256","src/pipeline.js:1-12","src/batch.js:38-58"]}
{"unit_id":"Nicholaskin__vision-exp-tile#card-en","repo":"Nicholaskin/vision-exp-tile","commit":"eb60e9104cc5999dda2a0a728550301be70123a8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"vision-exp-tile is a DSH Web plugin for large images. It creates coordinate-labeled tiles, inspects images, recognizes regions, and combines results. Its batch tool records progress, isolates failures, and resumes work. Useful for screenshots, charts, and scans; DeepSeek is the default endpoint.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:1252-1256","src/pipeline.js:1-12","src/batch.js:38-58"]}
