{"unit_id":"Nicholaskin__vision-exp-tile#feature-1","repo":"Nicholaskin/vision-exp-tile","commit":"eb60e9104cc5999dda2a0a728550301be70123a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"vision-exp-tile 的功能「大图网格切块」：把图片按网格拆成 PNG 或 JPEG 小块，并附每块在原图中的坐标和切块清单。调用 vision_tile_split，输入图片路径及可选块大小、重叠量和输出目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:448-480","src/tile-engine.js:1-45"]}
{"unit_id":"Nicholaskin__vision-exp-tile#feature-2","repo":"Nicholaskin/vision-exp-tile","commit":"eb60e9104cc5999dda2a0a728550301be70123a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"vision-exp-tile 的功能「智能识图」：先预检整图，再结合文字区域 OCR、兴趣区域视觉识别并汇总。调用 vision_tile_recognize，可选择 smart、pipeline 或 full 策略并提供识别问题。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:583-620","src/pipeline.js:1-12"]}
{"unit_id":"Nicholaskin__vision-exp-tile#feature-3","repo":"Nicholaskin/vision-exp-tile","commit":"eb60e9104cc5999dda2a0a728550301be70123a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"vision-exp-tile 的功能「区域裁剪识别」：按相对比例或像素矩形裁出图片区域，可保存裁剪图或提交视觉识别。调用 vision_region_crop，输入图片路径、矩形坐标及识别选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:912-960"]}
{"unit_id":"Nicholaskin__vision-exp-tile#feature-4","repo":"Nicholaskin/vision-exp-tile","commit":"eb60e9104cc5999dda2a0a728550301be70123a8","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"vision-exp-tile 的功能「目录批量识别」：枚举目录图片并逐张处理，单张失败会记录后继续，还能根据进度索引续跑并生成报告。调用 vision_batch_recognize，设置输入目录、策略和本次处理预算。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:1075-1140","src/batch.js:38-58"]}
